  {
   "who": "N",
   "say": "Talbot Edwards, keeper of the jewels, was seventy-seven. For a fee, he'd show the jewels to visitors. You could just ask."
  },
  {
   "who": "N",
   "say": "Enter Thomas Blood, an Irish-born adventurer who'd already been mixed up in plots against the government.",
