      "id": "blood",
      "x": 0.35,
      "mood": "happy",
      "pose": "wave"
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "who": "blood",
   "say": "Oh, I will. And next time, I'll bring my nephew. He's single."
  },
  {
   "who": "N",
   "say": "It was all a setup. On the ninth of May, Blood arrived with his son playing the nephew, plus three other men.",
   "show": {
