  {
   "who": "N",
   "say": "It was a gallant attempt, he supposedly said, because it was for a crown.",
   "show": {
    "k": "quote",
    "text": "It was a gallant attempt, however unsuccessful! It was for a crown!",
    "who": "Colonel Thomas Blood on his arrest, as traditionally reported (1671)"
   }
  },
  {
   "who": "N",
   "say": "Blood would explain himself only to the king, Charles the Second. And somehow, the king agreed to see him.",
